{"id":"1973566be420c068","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-well-ordering-proof.md","title":"Well-ordering Proof","display":"thm-well-ordering-proof — Well-ordering Proof","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-well-ordering-proof","aliases":["72-thm-well-ordering-proof"],"display":"thm-well-ordering-proof — Well-ordering Proof","depends_on":["[[72-thm-epsilon-0-ti]]","[[72-thm-ordinal-analysis-pa]]","[[72-lem-epsilon-0-notation]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IV §2.1.3, print238–240/PDF250–252","verification_status":"source-and-argument-reviewed","proof_status":"derived from source-statement-checked results","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-well-ordering-proof"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-well-ordering-proof</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-well-ordering-proof — Well-ordering Proof"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"76fae203d87d09fc\" href=\"?note=76fae203d87d09fc\" title=\"72-thm-epsilon-0-ti\">72-thm-epsilon-0-ti</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8f89d4e14473676b\" href=\"?note=8f89d4e14473676b\" title=\"72-thm-ordinal-analysis-pa\">72-thm-ordinal-analysis-pa</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3e21ee2923aace9a\" href=\"?note=3e21ee2923aace9a\" title=\"72-lem-epsilon-0-notation\">72-lem-epsilon-0-notation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IV §2.1.3, print238–240/PDF250–252"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-and-argument-reviewed"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"derived from source-statement-checked results"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>记号、初段表示、证明关系及一致性条件同 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"76fae203d87d09fc\" href=\"?note=76fae203d87d09fc\" title=\"72-thm-epsilon-0-ti\">72-thm-epsilon-0-ti</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 为自由集变量。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall a\\in\\operatorname{OT}_{\\varepsilon_0}\\quad\\mathsf{NT}\\vdash_2\\operatorname{TI}_{e_{&lt;a}}(X),\\qquad |\\mathsf{PA}|=\\operatorname{otp}(D_\\varepsilon,R_\\varepsilon)=\\varepsilon_0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall a\\in\\operatorname{OT}_{\\varepsilon_0}\\quad\\mathsf{NT}\\vdash_2\\operatorname{TI}_{e_{&lt;a}}(X),\\qquad |\\mathsf{PA}|=\\operatorname{otp}(D_\\varepsilon,R_\\varepsilon)=\\varepsilon_0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>此节点为既有名称的兼容推论，不另立一套TI定义或Π⁰₁序数约定。第一式由固定初段定理实例化A(x):=x∈X；第二式结合CNF记号引理和PA序数定理。可证性仍是逐a元模式，不是一个NT内部对所有a统一的句子。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-thm-epsilon-0-ti","status":"resolved","id":"76fae203d87d09fc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-epsilon-0-ti]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-ordinal-analysis-pa","status":"resolved","id":"8f89d4e14473676b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-ordinal-analysis-pa]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-epsilon-0-notation","status":"resolved","id":"3e21ee2923aace9a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-lem-epsilon-0-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-epsilon-0-ti","status":"resolved","id":"76fae203d87d09fc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"记号、初段表示、证明关系及一致性条件同 [[72-thm-epsilon-0-ti]]。$X$ 为自由集变量。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall a\\in\\operatorname{OT}_{\\varepsilon_0}\\quad\\mathsf{NT}\\vdash_2\\operatorname{TI}_{e_{<a}}(X),\\qquad |\\mathsf{PA}|=\\operatorname{otp}(D_\\varepsilon,R_\\varepsilon)=\\varepsilon_0.","display":true}],"bytes":1261,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-152","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-well-ordering-proof|thm-well-ordering-proof — Well-ordering Proof]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-152","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-thm-well-ordering-proof|thm-well-ordering-proof — Well-ordering Proof]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-343","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-thm-well-ordering-proof|72-thm-well-ordering-proof]]"}],"outgoing":["76fae203d87d09fc","8f89d4e14473676b","3e21ee2923aace9a"]}